  "version": "0.6.0",
  "notes": "### Added\n- Per-device areas: choose which areas each device syncs. A device given only some areas, such as a work laptop with only Work, cannot decrypt your other areas, Money, Learning or Vault, while your own computer keeps one combined view.\n- A guided setup in Settings > Sync checks that every device runs this version, previews what moves to each area, makes a backup and switches with one Undo. It can turn the feature off again the same way.\n- New devices can sync everything or only some areas. Another of your devices approves the request, and you can revoke an area from any device later.\n- A device with only some areas hides Money, Learning, Sketches and Vault. Switch to full device unlocks everything with your passphrase or recovery key.\n- Calendar events and notes can belong to an area.\n\n### Changed\n- Area tags reserved by Windows, such as con or nul, can no longer be used for new or renamed areas.\n\n### Fixed\n- Renaming or deleting an area changes only the tag in each task and keeps the rest of the line as written.",
